OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers in the evening, the odd heavy
OL,7,Fone at first. A few showers continue
OL,8,Fovernight but lighter and more
OL,9,Fisolated with increasing clear spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA few light showers in the
OL,12,Fmorning, but increasingly dry with
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Gradually cloudier with
OL,14,Fsome showers in afternoon then a band
OL,15,Fof heavy rain pushes east in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
