OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FFrequent heavy and blustery showers on
OL,7,FThursday. Showers easing Friday
OL,8,Fmorning with bright spells, then
OL,9,Ffurther rain spreading east later.
OL,10,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
